### Pruebas manuales de POST /expenses (extensión REST Client de VS Code). Datos ficticios.
### Antes: crea una tarjeta (cards.http), una cuenta (accounts.http) y un préstamo (loans.http), y
### cambia los ids de abajo por los que te devolvieron:
###   @cardId = tarjeta, @accountId = cuenta, @loanId = préstamo
@host = http://localhost:3001
@token = pega-aqui-el-accessToken-de-auth.http
@cardId = 1
@accountId = 2
@loanId = 3

### 1. Gasto desde una cuenta -> 201 { "id": ... }
POST {{host}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-03-12",
  "amountCents": 20000000,
  "sourceProductId": {{accountId}},
  "description": "Mercado"
}

### 2. Compra con tarjeta a 12 cuotas -> 201
POST {{host}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-03-12",
  "amountCents": 120000000,
  "sourceProductId": {{cardId}},
  "installments": 12,
  "description": "Televisor"
}

### 3. Con tarjeta y promoción al 0 % -> 201
POST {{host}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-03-12",
  "amountCents": 120000000,
  "sourceProductId": {{cardId}},
  "installments": 12,
  "promo": { "ea": "0", "description": "12 cuotas sin interés" }
}

### 4. Desde una cuenta con cuotas -> 400
POST {{host}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-03-12",
  "amountCents": 20000000,
  "sourceProductId": {{accountId}},
  "installments": 3
}

### 5. Con tarjeta y sin cuotas -> 400
POST {{host}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-03-12",
  "amountCents": 20000000,
  "sourceProductId": {{cardId}}
}

### 6. Desde un préstamo -> 400
POST {{host}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-03-12",
  "amountCents": 20000000,
  "sourceProductId": {{loanId}}
}

### 7. Un producto que no existe -> 400 (el mensaje trae el id)
POST {{host}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-03-12",
  "amountCents": 20000000,
  "sourceProductId": 999
}

### 8. Promoción con una M.V. que no cuadra -> 400
POST {{host}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-03-12",
  "amountCents": 120000000,
  "sourceProductId": {{cardId}},
  "installments": 12,
  "promo": { "ea": "0.2899", "mv": "0.0241" }
}

### 9. Una categoría que no existe -> 400
POST {{host}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-03-12",
  "amountCents": 20000000,
  "sourceProductId": {{accountId}},
  "categoryId": 999
}
